Short:        Most of the old ClassACT examples converted to OS4
Author:       Simon Archer
Uploader:     Nicolas Mendoza <mendoza pvv ntnu no>
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.0
Architecture: generic

Here is a collection of the ClassACT examples that have been converted to OS4.

All examples compile and run by executing the source file, and should work with
a standard OS4 SDK install.

Copyrights are still to the original authors, and they have been 'updated' for
ReAction.

Feel free to use these example sources to assist you in creating yet more good
software for our newest incarnation of AmigaOS

Simon
